WEBVTT

00:05:59.313 --> 00:06:01.148
But as she grows,

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.276
I know she and the rest of her generation

00:06:04.276 --> 00:06:06.695
will build Ukraine again.

00:06:07.738 --> 00:06:13.244
We will rehabilitate our roads,
our schools, our hospitals,

00:06:13.285 --> 00:06:15.871
our houses and people.

00:06:16.831 --> 00:06:19.542
Fueled by knowledge and curiosity,

00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:24.713
we will walk again the path
to become a prosperous, free nation.

00:06:25.881 --> 00:06:29.343
If you stand with us.

00:06:29.885 --> 00:06:32.513
So please,